0 FILE 10170 - main.ldr
0 Freight train: a flatbed rail car (with two wheel bogies, magnetic couplings and a deck of plates, side panels, ladders, grille tiles and brackets) pulling three interchangeable cargo containers — one long container and two shorter ones with grille-detailed walls and handles
